        "!g1 g2:real^1->real^N.\n        arc g1 /\\ arc g2 /\\\n        pathfinish g1 = pathstart g2 /\\\n        pathfinish g2 = pathstart g1 /\\\n        (path_image g1 INTER path_image g2) SUBSET\n            {pathstart g1,pathstart g2}\n        ==> simple_path(g1 ++ g2)",
      ),
      t509,
    ),
  )
}

