        "!f:real^M->real^N s.\n        f continuous_on s /\\ dimindex(:N) <= dimindex(:M) /\\\n        (!x y. x IN s /\\ y IN s /\\ f x = f y ==> x = y)\n        ==> IMAGE f (interior s) SUBSET interior(IMAGE f s)",
